で動かないんだった","ts":"1635854433.011500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cj2s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3DF63290-407E-4A16-B39C-A47372EA4FC9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"gls入れますね・・・","ts":"1635854411.010800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XSaj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6dd8dbfc-1859-46e6-81a1-0a4b3b1f276c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、GNU独自オプションね","ts":"1635854408.010600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WOr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"924a9715-d006-4d15-8c50-41e19b58c758","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、挙動がかわるというか実装されてるオプションが違うというやつですね。gnuのがいっぱい実装されてて便利","ts":"1635854393.010100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S6P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34860b13-2535-4a1a-baf0-4c9da82a398a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ええw lsも挙動違うんだw","ts":"1635854350.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YZJDE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0befe60-4ab2-413e-ab36-82ca91d43c23","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そう、 `ls` コマンドに依存してるのでgnuのかbsdのなのかで挙動が変わるんですよね","ts":"1635854317.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VKUtQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75176229-b904-47a9-843b-62c8bb51d08d","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"僕の場合はこの設定もしないとだめでした (Emacs28)\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/d12frosted/homebrew-emacs-plus/issues/383#issuecomment-899157143\u003e","ts":"1635854172.007700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/d12frosted/homebrew-emacs-plus/issues/383#issuecomment-899157143|Comment on #383 Listing directory failed but ‘access-file’ worked\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/d12frosted/homebrew-emacs-plus/issues/383#issuecomment-899157143|Comment on #383 Listing directory failed but ‘access-file’ worked\u003e","text":"UPDATE:\n\nTurned out this line in my config broke it, due to macos built in `ls` doesn't support `--group-directories-first` flag\n\n```\n(setq dired-listing-switches \"-al --group-directories-first\")\n\n```\n\nSolution:\n\n```\nbrew install coreutils\n\n```\n\nThen in your init.el, add\n\n```\n(setq insert-directory-program \"gls\" dired-use-ls-dired t)\n(setq dired-listing-switches \"-al --group-directories-first\")\n\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/d12frosted/homebrew-emacs-plus|d12frosted/homebrew-emacs-plus\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1629078040}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ebPeX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c38f5dbe-6001-4494-9c3d-f152257ea000","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"別解として terminal から /Applications/Emacs.app/Contents/MacOS/Emacs を叩いてしまうというのもあります（私はこちらでした","ts":"1635838603.006900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8pa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4aab490-3d04-48eb-aa27-5307d8dfb937","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"です。割によく報告のあるもの","ts":"1635838556.006300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HR9sN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a25c326a-cdac-452f-8771-403d4b33575c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いまこうなのかな?\n\u003chttps://srad.jp/~yuuka_mania/journal/650580/\u003e","ts":"1635838187.005900","attachments":[{"fallback":"install Emacs on MacOSX | yuuka_maniaの日記 | スラド","id":1,"title":"install Emacs on MacOSX | yuuka_maniaの日記 | スラド","title_link":"https://srad.jp/~yuuka_mania/journ